Package: nbzinbWebster
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression models by iteratively reweighted least squares for the coefficients alternated with Newton-Raphson for the dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial models by an EM algorithm with IRLS M-steps. No general-purpose optimizer is used.
